GIVEN policy  IS A `The policy`
      conduct IS A `The Insured's conduct`
      loss    IS A `A Part 1 loss`
      `as at` IS A DATE
GIVETH A LIST OF `A ground under Part 1`
`the grounds on which a Part 1 claim fails, under` policy `with` conduct `for` loss `, as at` `as at` MEANS
    concat
        (LIST `those that hold among`
                  (LIST PAIR `Introduction: cover had not attached` (NOT `cover has attached under` policy)
                      , PAIR `the item claimed is not insured under Part 1`
                             (NOT `the item` (loss's `the item claimed`) `is insured under Part 1 of` summary)
                      , PAIR `the property is not within the definition of the item claimed`
                             (NOT `the property is within the item claimed, under` policy `:` loss)
                      , PAIR `no sudden and unforeseen physical loss, destruction or damage`
                             (   NOT loss's `sudden and unforeseen`
                              OR loss's `the extent` EQUALS `no physical loss, destruction or damage`)
                      , PAIR `the loss was not in the Period of Insurance`
                             (NOT `within the Period of Insurance of` summary `, on` (loss's `the date of the loss`))
                      , PAIR `the loss was not at the Insured Location`
                             (   NOT `the premises are the Insured Location` (policy's `the premises`)
                              OR NOT `at the Insured Location` (loss's `where the property was`)))
            , map (GIVEN g YIELD `an Insured Peril ground` g)
                  (`the grounds under the Insured Perils that defeat` loss `, at` (policy's `the premises`))
            , `Part 1 exclusions 1 to 8 that apply to` loss
            , map (GIVEN g YIELD `a General Exclusion` g)
                  (`the General Exclusions that apply to` (loss's `the circumstances`) `caused by` (loss's `the cause`) `at` (policy's `the premises`))
            , map (GIVEN g YIELD `a General Condition` g)
                  (`the grounds under the General Conditions on` conduct `, event on` (loss's `the date of the loss`)
                       `, theft` (   loss's `the cause` EQUALS `theft or attempted theft`
                                  OR loss's `the cause` EQUALS `malicious act of any person`)
                       `, under` (LIST `Part 1`) `, as at` `as at`))
    WHERE
        summary MEANS policy's `the Policy Summary`

@ref Part 1, src:293-299
GIVEN policy  IS A `The policy`
      conduct IS A `The Insured's conduct`
      loss    IS A `A Part 1 loss`
      `as at` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Part 1 covers the loss, under` policy `with` conduct `for` loss `, as at` `as at` MEANS
    null (`the grounds on which a Part 1 claim fails, under` policy `with` conduct `for` loss `, as at` `as at`)

§§ `Exclusions`

-- The Insurer shall not be liable for:
-- 1. scratching, denting, chipping or marring;
-- 2. loss caused by wear and tear, depreciation, cleaning, dyeing, alteration, repair or
--    restoration of any article, the action of light or atmospheric conditions, rot, mildew,
--    rust, moths, insects, vermin, or any other gradually operating cause;
-- 3. electrical or electronic breakdown, malfunction or failure to operate, manufacturer's
--    defect or design defect;
-- 4. consequential loss of any kind;
-- 5. loss arising directly or indirectly from unexplained loss or mysterious disappearance;
