-- Actual Value is the reasonable and necessary cost of rebuilding, replacing or repairing
-- with new materials, less depreciation and wear based on age and condition at the time of
-- loss. No rate of depreciation is stated (finding X-discretion); the figure is an input.
-- src:286 | Giá Trị Thực Tế
