-- src:288 | trừ đi khấu hao và hao mòn dựa trên số năm sử dụng và tình trạng của tài sản vào thời điểm xảy ra tổn
-- src:289 | thất, phá hủy hoặc thiệt hại.
-- "Reasonable dispatch" has no measure in the document either; whether it was met is an input.
@ref Part 1, Cơ Sở Thực Hiện Bồi Thường (a)-(b) and Các Quy định 1-3, src:301-323; Giá Trị Thực Tế, src:286-289
GIVEN loss    IS A `A Part 1 loss`
      figures IS A `The figures for a Part 1 loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part 1: the cost after Provisions 1 to 3, for` loss `on` figures MEANS
    IF   `Provision 2 applies`
    THEN min `after Provisions 1 and 3` `the cost had it been wholly lost`
    ELSE `after Provisions 1 and 3`
    WHERE
        `after Provisions 1 and 3` MEANS
            IF       figures's `reinstatement was begun and carried out with reasonable dispatch`
                 AND figures's `the cost of reinstatement has actually been incurred`
            THEN figures's `the cost of reinstatement`
            ELSE min (figures's `the cost of reinstatement`) (figures's `the Actual Value`)
        `Provision 2 applies` MEANS loss's `the extent` EQUALS `damaged`
        `the cost had it been wholly lost` MEANS
            CONSIDER figures's `the cost of reinstatement had the property been wholly lost`
            WHEN JUST c  THEN c
            WHEN NOTHING THEN `Provision 2 needs the cost of reinstatement had the property been wholly lost`

@ref Part 1, Các Quy định 2, src:320-321
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Provision 2 needs the cost of reinstatement had the property been wholly lost` MEANS
    REFUSE "Provision 2 needs the cost of reinstatement had the property been wholly lost"

§§ `Pairs and Sets`

-- For an item made up of a pair or set, liability is no more than the value of the part
-- lost or damaged, without regard to any special value it has as part of the pair or set,
-- and no more than a proportionate part of the sum insured on the pair or set.
-- F-pairs: "proportionate" is not defined; taken as parts lost over parts in the set. The
-- second cap applies only where the Summary insures the pair or set as such.
-- src:324 | Cặp và Bộ
-- src:325 | Với bất kỳ hạng mục được bảo hiểm nào bao gồm các vật đi thành đôi hoặc bộ, trách nhiệm của Công
-- src:326 | Ty Bảo Hiểm không vượt quá giá trị của bất kỳ phần hoặc các phần cụ thể nào có thể bị tổn thất hoặc
-- src:327 | thiệt hại mà không tính đến giá trị đặc biệt có thể có của vật hoặc các vật đó như là một phần thuộc cặp
-- src:328 | hoặc bộ vật đó, và cũng không vượt quá tỷ lệ của khoản tiền được bảo hiểm cho cặp hoặc bộ đó.
@ref Part 1, Cặp và Bộ, src:324-328 (fork F-pairs)
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      pair   IS A MAYBE `A pair or set`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Pairs and Sets: the cap on` amount `for` pair MEANS
    CONSIDER pair
    WHEN NOTHING THEN amount
    WHEN JUST p  THEN
        min (min amount (p's `the value of the parts lost, without special value as a pair or set`))
            (CONSIDER p's `the sum insured on the pair or set`
             WHEN NOTHING THEN amount
             WHEN JUST s  THEN s TIMES p's `the number of parts lost or damaged`
                                 DIVIDED BY p's `the number of parts in the pair or set`)

§§ `General Limit of Liability`

-- In no case does the Insurer's liability exceed (a) the total sum insured, or the sum
-- insured on any item, or any Limit of Liability, at the time of loss; (b) the sum insured
-- (or limit) remaining after deducting losses in the same Period of Insurance, unless the
-- Insurer has agreed to reinstate it.
-- src:330 | GIỚI HẠN TRÁCH NHIỆM - TỔNG QUÁT
-- src:331 | Trong mọi trường hợp, trách nhiệm của Công Ty Bảo Hiểm không vượt quá:
-- src:332 | (a) tổng số tiền bảo hiểm hoặc số tiền bảo hiểm của bất kỳ hạng mục nào trong số tiền bảo hiểm hoặc
-- src:333 | bất kỳ Giới Hạn Trách Nhiệm nào tại thời điểm xảy ra tổn thất, phá hủy hoặc thiệt hại;
-- src:334 | (b) số tiền bảo hiểm (hoặc giới hạn) còn lại sau khi trừ đi tổn thất, phá hủy hoặc thiệt hại phát sinh
-- src:335 | trong cùng Thời Hạn Bảo Hiểm, trừ khi Công Ty Bảo Hiểm đã đồng ý phục hồi số tiền bảo hiểm
-- src:336 | (hoặc giới hạn) đó.
@ref Part 1, Giới Hạn Trách Nhiệm - Tổng Quát (a)-(b), src:330-336
GIVEN item    IS A `A Part 1 item`
      summary IS A `The Policy Summary`
      figures IS A `The figures for a Part 1 loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`General Limit: what remains for` item `under` summary `after` figures MEANS
    CONSIDER `the sum insured stated for` item `in` summary
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the General Limit needs a sum insured on the item claimed`
    WHEN JUST si THEN
        `with any Part 1 Limit of Liability`
            (IF   figures's `the Insurer agreed to reinstate the sum insured`
             THEN si
             ELSE max 0 (si MINUS figures's `the amount already paid on this item in the Period`))
    WHERE
        `with any Part 1 Limit of Liability` x MEANS
            CONSIDER summary's `the Part 1 Limit of Liability`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN x
            WHEN JUST l  THEN min x l

@ref Part 1, src:330-336
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the General Limit needs a sum insured on the item claimed` MEANS
    REFUSE "the General Limit needs a sum insured on the item claimed"

§§ `The amount payable for a loss`

-- The order (F-order): the settlement basis and Provisions 1-3; GC6's cap where regulation
-- prevents reinstatement; Pairs and Sets; the General Limit; GC9's rateable proportion; and
-- last the Deductible, which GC13 applies "after all the other terms and conditions".
@ref Part 1, src:293-336; GC6, src:897-902; GC9, src:932-938; GC13, src:972-978 (fork F-order)
GIVEN policy  IS A `The policy`
      loss    IS A `A Part 1 loss`
      figures IS A `The figures for a Part 1 loss`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part 1: the indemnity before contribution and the Deductible, under` policy `for` loss `on` figures MEANS
    min `what remains of the sum insured` `after Pairs and Sets`
    WHERE
        `after Provisions` MEANS `Part 1: the cost after Provisions 1 to 3, for` loss `on` figures
        `after GC6` MEANS
            CONSIDER figures's `the cost had reinstatement been lawfully possible`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN `after Provisions`
            WHEN JUST c  THEN min `after Provisions` c
        `after Pairs and Sets` MEANS `Pairs and Sets: the cap on` `after GC6` `for` (figures's `the pair or set`)
        `what remains of the sum insured` MEANS
            `General Limit: what remains for` (loss's `the item claimed`) `under` (policy's `the Policy Summary`) `after` figures

@ref Part 1, src:293-336; GC9, src:932-938; GC13, src:972-978
GIVEN policy  IS A `The policy`
      conduct IS A `The Insured's conduct`
      loss    IS A `A Part 1 loss`
      figures IS A `The figures for a Part 1 loss`
      `as at` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part 1: the amount payable, under` policy `with` conduct `for` loss `on` figures `, as at` `as at` MEANS
    IF   `Part 1 covers the loss, under` policy `with` conduct `for` loss `, as at` `as at`
    THEN `GC13: less the Deductible` (`GC13: the Deductible stated in` summary `for` `Part 1`) `, payable on` `after GC9`
    ELSE 0
    WHERE
        summary MEANS policy's `the Policy Summary`
        `the indemnity` MEANS `Part 1: the indemnity before contribution and the Deductible, under` policy `for` loss `on` figures
        `after GC9` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the sum insured stated for` (loss's `the item claimed`) `in` summary
            WHEN NOTHING THEN `the General Limit needs a sum insured on the item claimed`
            WHEN JUST si THEN `GC9: the rateable proportion of` `the indemnity` `, insured here for` si
                                  `and elsewhere for` (figures's `the sums insured by other insurances of the same loss`)

§§ `Extensions`

-- 1. Alterations and repairs: workmen may work in the Home for repairs, minor additions,
-- alterations or decoration without prejudice to the policy. So their presence is not by
-- itself a GC3(b) increase of risk; the caller does not record it as one (input convention).
-- It does not displace Peril 5(f), which excludes storm loss to premises under alteration or
-- repair unless they are complete and storm-proof.
