-- src:346 | chữa và/hoặc bổ sung và thay đổi nhỏ và/hoặc trang trí mà không phương hại gì đến Hợp Đồng Bảo
-- src:347 | Hiểm này.
@ref Part 1, Extension 1, src:343-347
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Extension 1: workmen doing repairs, minor alterations or decoration do not prejudice the policy` MEANS TRUE

-- 2. Valuation: if the total claimed for any one loss does not exceed 40,000,000 dong or 5%
-- of the sum insured, whichever is less, item by item, no special inventory or appraisal of
-- undamaged property is required. Where an item covers two or more Homes the clause applies
-- to the Homes and/or Contents item by item. "Không vượt quá" (does not exceed) is inclusive.
-- The clause waives an inventory for an average (underinsurance) calculation the document
-- never states. LAW: Law 08/2022/QH15 art 48 (aid, lines 955-963) reduces payment pro rata
-- where the sum insured is below market value. Noted, not encoded.
-- src:348 | 2. Định giá
