`Extension 6: temporary protection payable under` summary `on` costs MEANS
    min (costs's `costs of temporary protection`) (10% TIMES `the total sum insured under Part 1 of` summary)

-- The Extensions inside the General Limit (F-ext-within): the General Limit binds "in all
-- cases", so a loss with its Extension 3 and 5 costs stays within what remains of the item's
-- sum insured, and with Extensions 4 and 6 within the total sum insured; then GC9 and the
-- one Deductible.
@ref Part 1, General Limit src:330-336 with Extensions 3-6, src:355-392 (fork F-ext-within)
GIVEN policy  IS A `The policy`
      conduct IS A `The Insured's conduct`
      loss    IS A `A Part 1 loss`
      figures IS A `The figures for a Part 1 loss`
      costs   IS A `The costs claimed under the Part 1 Extensions`
      `as at` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Part 1: the amount payable with Extension costs, under` policy `with` conduct `for` loss `on` figures `and` costs `, as at` `as at` MEANS
    IF   `Part 1 covers the loss, under` policy `with` conduct `for` loss `, as at` `as at`
    THEN `GC13: less the Deductible` (`GC13: the Deductible stated in` summary `for` `Part 1`) `, payable on` `after GC9`
    ELSE 0
    WHERE
        summary MEANS policy's `the Policy Summary`
        item    MEANS loss's `the item claimed`
        `the item's share` MEANS
            min (`General Limit: what remains for` item `under` summary `after` figures)
                (    `Part 1: the indemnity before contribution and the Deductible, under` policy `for` loss `on` figures
                 PLUS (IF item EQUALS `the Home` THEN `Extension 3: architects' and engineers' fees payable under` summary `on` costs ELSE 0)
                 PLUS `Extension 5: debris removal payable under` summary `for` item `on` costs)
        `before GC9` MEANS
            min (`the total sum insured under Part 1 of` summary)
                (    `the item's share`
                 PLUS `Extension 4: fire fighting costs payable under` summary `on` costs
                 PLUS `Extension 6: temporary protection payable under` summary `on` costs)
        `after GC9` MEANS
            `GC9: the rateable proportion of` `before GC9` `, insured here for` (fromMaybe 0 (`the sum insured stated for` item `in` summary))
                `and elsewhere for` (figures's `the sums insured by other insurances of the same loss`)

-- 7. 72 hours: loss in any 72 consecutive hours from earthquake, seaquake, tidal wave or
-- volcanic eruption, whirlwind, storm, flood or hail from atmospheric disturbance is one event,
-- and so one loss for the Deductible. The Insured chooses when each 72-hour period starts;
-- no two periods may overlap. F-72h: a period is closed at both ends (a loss at hour 72 of a
-- period is in it), and the Insured, choosing, starts each period at the earliest loss not
-- yet covered, which gives the fewest periods. Hours are counted on any one clock the caller
-- chooses. Two of the events it names (seaquake, tidal wave) are not Insured Perils and one
-- (hail) is excluded by Peril 5(a).
-- src:393 | 7. Điều chỉnh Thời gian
-- src:394 | Các bên đồng ý rằng bất kỳ tổn thất hoặc thiệt hại nào đối với tài sản được bảo hiểm phát sinh trong
-- src:395 | thời hạn 72 giờ liên tục, do động đất, chấn động dưới biển, thủy triều hoặc sự phun trào núi lửa, lốc
-- src:396 | xoáy, giông bão, lũ lụt hoặc mưa đá xảy ra do xáo động khí quyển, sẽ được xem như là một sự kiện
-- src:397 | riêng biệt và do đó tạo thành một tổn thất liên quan đến Mức Miễn Thường được quy định trong Hợp
-- src:398 | Đồng Bảo Hiểm. Để phục vụ mục đích của quy định nêu trên, thời điểm bắt đầu thời hạn 72 giờ sẽ
-- src:399 | được quyết định theo ý của Người Được Bảo Hiểm. Tuy nhiên, được hiểu và thống nhất rằng sẽ
-- src:400 | không có sự trùng lắp hai hoặc nhiều thời hạn 72 giờ như vậy trường hợp thiệt hại xảy ra trong
-- src:401 | khoảng thời gian dài hơn.
@ref Part 1, Extension 7, src:393-401 (fork F-72h)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Extension 7: the hours in one event` MEANS 72

@ref Part 1, Extension 7, src:394-396
GIVEN cause IS A `A cause of loss`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Extension 7 groups losses caused by` cause MEANS
       cause EQUALS `earthquake`
    OR cause EQUALS `volcanic eruption`
    OR cause EQUALS `seaquake, tidal wave or hail`
    OR cause EQUALS `whirlwind`
    OR cause EQUALS `storm`
    OR cause EQUALS `typhoon`
    OR cause EQUALS `flood`

@ref Part 1, Extension 7, src:393-401 (fork F-72h)
GIVEN hours IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Extension 7: the number of events, for losses at hours` hours MEANS
    `count the periods` (sort hours)
    WHERE
        `count the periods` hs MEANS
            CONSIDER hs
            WHEN EMPTY THEN 0
            WHEN h FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
                1 PLUS `count the periods` (filter (GIVEN x YIELD x GREATER THAN h PLUS `Extension 7: the hours in one event`) rest)

-- The Deductibles for a series of catastrophe losses at one Insured Location: one per event.
@ref Part 1, Extension 7, src:396-398; GC13, src:972-976
GIVEN summary IS A `The Policy Summary`
      hours   IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Extension 7: the Deductibles borne under` summary `for losses at hours` hours MEANS
    `Extension 7: the number of events, for losses at hours` hours
        TIMES `GC13: the Deductible stated in` summary `for` `Part 1`
